                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c239882b-69ed-3390-aea9-8a51853fb03e",
                                        "entry_id": "61fb79d6-909c-333a-b749-ce134014f478",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sufficient to satisfy a requirement or meet a need; sufficiently; satisfactorily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca61f94c-781b-4169-944a-32dcdad3d893",
                                                "sense_id": "c239882b-69ed-3390-aea9-8a51853fb03e",
                                                "text": "A loving relationship with a proper companion animal, a relationship that adequately provides for the animal's physical and psychological needs, is not at all inconsistent with the principles and advocacy of animal rights."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd20b90-0ab6-36f7-9efb-2c39e7b3e9d6",
                                        "entry_id": "61fb79d6-909c-333a-b749-ce134014f478",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Barely satisfactory or sufficient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c0754bb-c351-4249-b2a6-aa22d6086ee9",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c54d238-164d-3a4d-9f99-0a25d6089bb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e9bea98-5327-3e05-826b-132afe126a39",
                        "target_lang_word": "accordingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "accordingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f4eac6f-c807-323d-b8fb-ce3f4cde3aae",
                                        "entry_id": "44ca7c93-adfe-3c24-b705-35caaa9f5c18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agreeably; correspondingly; suitably"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50e57f84-209f-4221-927d-27bdbb7accdd",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4eac6f-c807-323d-b8fb-ce3f4cde3aae",
                                                "text": "He was absent when I called, and I accordingly left my card."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4deccf6f-0f0f-4362-a87e-d9d41634181e",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4eac6f-c807-323d-b8fb-ce3f4cde3aae",
                                                "text": "We may the number of ships behold, and so proceed accordingly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16a21266-c878-4b70-ab3f-1655ca789a25",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4eac6f-c807-323d-b8fb-ce3f4cde3aae",
                                                "text": "Now, I still think that for this box of matches to have escaped the wear of time for immemorial years was a strange, and for me, a most fortunate thing. Yet oddly enough I found here a far more unlikely substance, and that was camphor. I found it in a sealed jar, that, by chance, I supposed had been really hermetically sealed. I fancied at first the stuff was paraffin wax, and smashed the jar accordingly. But the odor of camphor was unmistakable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71aa2370-9d54-41a1-8bcb-b1c6b1988980",
                                                "sense_id": "9f4eac6f-c807-323d-b8fb-ce3f4cde3aae",
                                                "text": "From the Marvel Mixmaster to the Miracle Microwave, every time a new-fangled gadget has lobbed into the Aussie kitchen, Aussie mums have changed their cooking styles accordingly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18f86c6c-b912-370b-8c7e-8121a88a250c",
                                        "entry_id": "44ca7c93-adfe-3c24-b705-35caaa9f5c18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In natural sequence; consequently; so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b0f082e-0a85-4f3b-8542-8d98fdeb255c",
                                                "sense_id": "18f86c6c-b912-370b-8c7e-8121a88a250c",
                                                "text": "Our preparations were all finished. Accordingly, we set sail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b48aa1a1-f27c-42dc-ac13-40cd125e4da4",
                                                "sense_id": "18f86c6c-b912-370b-8c7e-8121a88a250c",
                                                "text": "Accordingly a young chap wearing his hat over the left eyebrow, some clerk I suppose, - there must have been clerks in the business, though the house was as still as a house in a city of the dead, - came from somewhere up-stairs, and led me forth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a35914d-fc2c-441d-b092-d49c954d78d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c54d238-164d-3a4d-9f99-0a25d6089bb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e9bea98-5327-3e05-826b-132afe126a39",
                        "target_lang_word": "合适",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ba0d81b-ee66-4a34-b6e7-6ca5c993e903",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c54d238-164d-3a4d-9f99-0a25d6089bb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e9bea98-5327-3e05-826b-132afe126a39",
                        "target_lang_word": "convenablement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "convenablement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a550084e-2ef2-353b-b83d-6d4bd9794c6c",
                                        "entry_id": "e14c761e-7da0-3025-beb9-9f12ae6526cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière convenable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11bac23f-fa20-4540-91d6-dfb26451bde8",
                                                "sense_id": "a550084e-2ef2-353b-b83d-6d4bd9794c6c",
                                                "text": "En réalité, ce vin du Caucase, quelque peu aigrelet, accompagne convenablement la poule bouillie, disons le « pilau », – ce qui permet de lui trouver une saveur spéciale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "879fe79e-074c-4b8f-8b11-0b03d84abda0",
                                                "sense_id": "a550084e-2ef2-353b-b83d-6d4bd9794c6c",
                                                "text": "Un moulin à vent se compose essentiellement d'un arbre porté sur un petit bâtiment en bois, qui est susceptible de tourner autour d'un fort pivot vertical, et qui peut par conséquent être orienté convenablement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2886014e-b998-48eb-9fe9-4b369e85b12a",
                                                "sense_id": "a550084e-2ef2-353b-b83d-6d4bd9794c6c",
                                                "text": "En mettant de côté les supporteurs argentino-indiens, dont le cas reste à élucider, seuls les Tunisiens et les Marcains réussissent à faire monter les décibels à peu près convenablement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eade4c41-fd84-3e58-a376-28ba10257246",
                                        "entry_id": "e14c761e-7da0-3025-beb9-9f12ae6526cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conformément."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9b5ba83-a801-4c39-9b59-bcd72e79a0f8",
                                                "sense_id": "eade4c41-fd84-3e58-a376-28ba10257246",
                                                "text": "J'agirai convenablement à vos vues."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7fb26ea6-f6f6-44c5-9ef3-2c28d97519f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c54d238-164d-3a4d-9f99-0a25d6089bb0",
                        "source_sense_id": "0716860e-ddee-32da-8e18-8cc1d8cbeb55",
                        "target_lang_word": "respectively",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "respectively",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                        "entry_id": "6af43b70-b98f-39c8-8894-890e78f17b13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a relative manner; often used when comparing array lists, where the term denotes that the items in the lists correspond to each other in the order they are given."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65a4fb8f-b0fc-49a6-b218-fba4b0941229",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "Serena Williams and Roger Federer won the women's and men's singles titles, respectively, at the 2010 Australian Open."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bc24096-5c44-49dd-955b-508dab055202",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "The 49th and 50th states of the United States of America are Alaska and Hawaii, respectively."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d6a5566-e07e-4d7e-878d-23617a390d9d",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "Visible distance behind and before us, is respectively our image of memory and hope."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cf4330d-7fe8-44aa-9fd8-4180f5b4f6a3",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "If, as we have said, the sun were a ball nine feet across, our earth would, in proportion, be the size of a one-inch ball, and at a distance of 323 yards from the sun. The moon would be a speck the size of a small pea, thirty inches from the earth. Nearer to the sun than the earth would be two other very similar specks, the planets Mercury and Venus, at a distance of 125 and 250 yards respectively. Beyond the earth would come the planets Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune, at distances of 500, 1806, 3000, 6000, and 9500 yards respectively."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b99d8a-364f-49ff-974c-0e477ce0a873",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "Two tao with three and five perforations, respectively, made of black jade, were found at the site of Shih-mao in Shensi, Yü-lin District, Shen-mu County. Their total lengths are 49 and 55 centimeters.⁴⁷"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33a18a44-14d0-4c11-9857-1feee69933f4",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "Despite of the absence of Shaun Derry and Adel Taarabt because of illness and injury respectively, the home side began superbly. Helguson twice threatened early on with shots from the right-hand corner of the box before Anton Ferdinand spurned a great chance at the back post following the Icelandic striker's header back across goal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e31a61b-0d71-430d-844c-09ef2e683307",
                                                "sense_id": "9377c6dd-b6eb-3dcd-a0de-d2be5044f810",
                                                "text": "Arriva and MTR, both private companies, are paid a fixed fee to operate Overground and Elizabeth line services respectively."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
